+      "text": "Base directory for this skill: C:\\Code\\lew42\\monorepo\\.claude\\skills\\page\n\nRead the readme chain at /framework/design/ (root → design), then its children's readmes for\nthe part you're doing: layout, color, navigation, content, ui. Each links its own\nquestions.md, which `review` reads.\n\nOverview: the order of the job is what it is → where it lives (navigation) → how big it is\n(layout) → what it says (content) → what the reader presses (ui, carried by color). The two\ntests for every element: self-evident, and necessary. A page's inbox (coordination notes) is a\nServex fact, not a design one — see /framework/ai/inboxes/.\n"
